OL,3,GNEWSAParty Rock Anthem singer struggled
OL,4,Awith mental health before death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British singer who was a member of
OL,7,Fthe girl group G.R.L took her own life,
OL,8,Fan inquest has found.
OL,10,FLauren Bennett, 36, who also featured
OL,11,Fon LMFAO's 2011 hit Party Rock Anthem,
OL,12,Fwas found dead in Kent on 29 May.
OL,14,FIn a statement read out by a coroner on
OL,15,FFriday, her husband Kenny Wormald said
OL,16,Fshe had been struggling with severe
OL,17,Fmental health issues before her death.
OL,19,FHe said she told him she was going out
OL,20,Ffor a walk on the morning of her death
OL,21,Fwhile he remained in bed.
